5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that is fair but doesn't alienate newcomers. I'll look into the taster evening forms from non-joiners and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'm interested in the administrative burden. I'll check the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements on last year's renewals.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to see how attendance is distributed. I'll look at the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll see why people are hesitant. I'll check the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know exactly what we're dealing with financially. I'll look into last year's ledger of outgoings and the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Does anyone else feel we should be looking at the bank statements? I'm curious if the payment timing affects how people join.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I have that covered. I suspect the timing is less about the joiners and more about the stress it puts on the person managing the books.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Benjamin. The administrative side is crucial, but I'm more concerned with whether the current system unfairly burdens our most active members.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, fairness is one thing, but we can't ignore the atmosphere. If people are weighing up every visit, the structure might be the problem.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not interested in ""atmosphere"" if we don't even know if the money is there. We need hard numbers before we start guessing about feelings.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, hard numbers are important, but the numbers are driven by people's behavior. If we ignore why they aren't joining or attending, the ledger will only get thinner.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, you make a fair point. However, we must balance the desire for growth with a sustainable workload for the committee. We cannot afford to burn out our volunteers.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Exactly. If we create a system that is ""fair"" on paper but creates a mountain of paperwork or resentment among the regulars, we've failed. We need a sustainable balance.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, I agree. But remember that ""sustainable"" also means people actually wanting to walk through the door without hesitation. If the fee feels like a barrier, the balance is already gone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're talking in circles. I'm looking at the ledger and the old minute books to see what actually worked and what we actually spent. Let's just get the data first.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let's proceed with our chosen research and see what the data tells us before we try to design the new structure.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,That seems the most logical path forward. I look forward to seeing how our findings intersect.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I'll be interested to see if the attendance patterns match the financial realities Takumi is looking for.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's hope the data is clear enough to stop the guessing. I'll see what the members are actually thinking.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Fine. Let's just get on with it and see who's actually paying for what.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
